title: "An Empirical Evaluation of Message Delivery Reliability and Recovery Characteristics in Redis Streams and NATS JetStream"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Bona
    given-names: Victor
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
abstract: "An empirical comparison of recovery policies, consumer concurrency, and acknowledgment costs in single-replica Redis Streams 7.4.2/8.10.2 and NATS JetStream 2.10.24/2.15.0. The original evidence is preserved alongside three separately provisioned fresh-store deployments on shared hardware. All proofs and detailed results are included in the complete article appendices. Manuscript and research material use CC-BY-4.0; original software and formalization use MIT. See LICENSE.md for third-party exceptions."
repository-code: "https://github.com/vicotrbb/redis-jetstream-reliability"
keywords:
  - Redis Streams
  - NATS JetStream
  - message recovery
  - durability
  - empirical evaluation
